# Line endings have one authority: this file.
#
# Before 8 Sep 2026 there was none, and core.autocrlf=true on the Windows
# checkout. The index was already all-LF, so the churn never showed in
# `git status` — it showed the moment anyone flipped autocrlf, and buried
# every real diff under ~170 files that differed only by a carriage return.
# See docs/STAGE_0.md S0-1..S0-2 and RULINGS-2026-09-08.md R-30.
#
# eol=lf beats core.autocrlf, so this holds regardless of each clone's config.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.sql  text eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.rar  binary
*.zip  binary
*.pdf  binary
